'''Starlight Beacon's Jedi temple''' was a [[Jedi temple]] located onboard the [[Starlight Beacon]] [[space station]].<ref name="Starlight" /> The largest temple outside of [[Coruscant]], it was intended to serve as a hub for the [[Jedi Order]]'s activities in the [[Outer Rim Territories]] and beyond. It had been designed by renowned [[Jedi]] [[architect]] [[Palo Hidalla]]. Staffed by some of the Order's most experienced members, it provided everything Jedi of all ranks might require to serve the people of [[the galaxy]] and [[the Force]]. The Jedi [[starship]] ''[[Ataraxia]]'' was also stationed at the Beacon. The Jedi were initially meant to be led by [[Jedi Master]] [[Jora Malli]], but after her [[death]] at the [[Battle of Kur]],<ref name="Light of the Jedi" /> Jedi Master [[Avar Kriss]] was selected for the position.<ref name="THR 1">[[The High Republic (2021) 1|''The High Republic'' (2021) 1]]</ref> [[Conduit 398-GX14]], where [[technician]]s [[Joss Adren|Joss]] and [[Pikka Adren]] discovered and fixed a fault with the station's power systems, was located near the temple.<ref name="Starlight" />

